From ab8e0cfaf6780095f6f8b855a27041d81148d7db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:27:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [dxgi] Port Wineland HDR detection to DXVK Low Latency

Follow live per-monitor Advanced Color state and EDID capabilities. Keep
explicit HDR overrides and color-space selection, without sharing HDR
state between outputs or caching it on swapchain creation.

Read HDR metadata across all CTA extensions. Preserve low-latency frame
pacing and the existing HUD integration.
---
